cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software with its version and exact Git commit. The manuscript is a
  distinct scientific object; no DOI is assigned to this repository.
type: software
title: "CRISPR observability: finite-universe bounds and sequence-correspondence checks"
version: "0.4.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Firmenich"
    given-names: "Facundo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-6578-3811"
    email: "f.firmenich@cedesur.org"
    affiliation: >-
      Centro de Estudios del Sur (CEDESUR), Spain and Argentina. For this project,
      academically affiliated with Universidad Nacional Arturo Jauretche (UNAJ),
